<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Over 28 pct of Telecasters traded.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Over 28 pct of Telecasters traded.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regional broadcaster Telecasters Australia Ltd saw over 28 percent of its shares traded in two lines shortly after the market opened.</p>
<p>Brokers said the two lines, one of 3.0 million shares and one of 2.65 million shares were specialled through Macquarie Equities at a price of A$6.50 per share.</p>
<p>The thinly traded stock saw no other trades by 11.15 a.m. (0015 GMT).</p>
<p>A company spokesman was unable to identify the buyers or sellers but said an announcement may be made later.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
